This workspace follows `AGENTS.md` at the root. Before any non-trivial work,
read it once. It's shared by Claude Code / Codex / Cursor / Gemini.

## End-of-task self-audit (MANDATORY)

Before you finish a turn, ask yourself for each:
- design-decision (ambiguous spec interpretation)
- deviation (departed from request, with why)
- tradeoff (weighed alternatives)
- open-question (need user confirmation)
- resolution (closing a prior open-question)

→ For every "yes", append via `python3 ~/.claude/skills/workspace-layout/scripts/notes.py --workspace <abs> --type <kind> --title "…" --body "…" --author cursor`.

"Nothing to log" only after explicitly running the audit. NOTES is append-
only; never edit prior entries.

## Context canary

End EVERY user-facing reply with the literal token `【All of the above】` on
its own line. Missing token = AGENTS.md no longer in context; user knows to
reset the session.
